"对于源码构建，请使用 vLLM Ascend **v0.30.0rc2** 标签下\n"
"`.github/vllm-release-tag.commit` 中记录的上游 vLLM 标签。"

msgid ""
"- **A3 single-node colocated**: one Atlas 800I A3 server with 8 NPUs and 128GB\n"
