" Prefill 到 Decode KV 传输。"

msgid "Key pooling parameters:"
msgstr "关键池化参数："

msgid ""
"- `MultiConnector` combines live P-to-D transfer through\n"
"  `MooncakeHybridConnector` with persistent prefix reuse through\n"
"  `AscendStoreConnector`.\n"
"- `backend: \"memcache\"` selects Memcache as the KV Cache Pool backend.\n"
"- `use_layerwise: false` is required for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash. Do not enable\n"
"  layerwise pooling for this model because its CED hybrid-attention structure\n"
"  is not supported by the layerwise path."
msgstr ""
"- `MultiConnector` 将通过 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 进行的实时 P-to-D 传输与通过 `AscendStoreConnector` 进行的持久化前缀复用相结合。\n"
"- `backend: \"memcache\"` 选择 Memcache 作为 KV Cache Pool 后端。\n"
"- DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 需要设置 `use_layerwise: false`。请勿为此模型启用分层池化，因为其 CED 混合注意力结构不受分层路径支持。"

msgid ""
"For Memcache configuration, capacity tuning, and troubleshooting, refer to the\n"
"[KV Cache Pool guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)."
msgstr ""
"有关 Memcache 配置、容量调优和故障排除，请参阅\n"
"[KV Cache Pool 指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md#scenario-2-memcache-backend)。"

msgid "### 5.4 1P1D Deployment with Mooncake KV Cache Pool"
msgstr "### 5.4 使用 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 的 1P1D 部署"

msgid ""
"This configuration extends the A2 1P1D deployment in Section 5.2 with a\n"
"Mooncake KV Cache Pool. `MooncakeHybridConnector` continues to transfer KV\n"
"cache from Prefill to Decode, while `AscendStoreConnector` stores reusable KV\n"
"cache in Mooncake. Both connectors are configured as children of\n"
"`MultiConnector`."
msgstr ""
"此配置在 5.2 节的 A2 1P1D 部署基础上增加了 Mooncake KV Cache "
"Pool。`MooncakeHybridConnector` 继续将 KV 缓存从 Prefill 传输到 Decode，而 "
"`AscendStoreConnector` 将可复用的 KV 缓存存储在 Mooncake 中。两个连接器均配置为 `MultiConnector` "
"的子连接器。"

msgid ""
"Before starting vLLM, configure `mooncake.json`, and start the\n"
"mooncake_master Service. The Prefill and Decode nodes must export `MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH` ."
msgstr ""
"在启动 vLLM 之前，配置 `mooncake.json` 并启动 mooncake_master 服务。Prefill 和 Decode "
"节点必须导出 `MOONCAKE_CONFIG_PATH`。"

msgid "#### 5.4.1 Prepare the Mooncake Services"
msgstr "#### 5.4.1 准备 Mooncake 服务"

msgid "Configure `mooncake.json`:"
msgstr "配置 `mooncake.json`："

msgid "Start mooncake_master:"
msgstr "启动 mooncake_master："

msgid ""
"After `mooncake.json` is ready, start the mooncake_master process on one "
"node and wait for successful initialization:"
msgstr "`mooncake.json` 就绪后，在一个节点上启动 mooncake_master 进程，并等待初始化成功："

msgid ""
"eviction_high_watermark_ratio determines the watermark where Mooncake Store will perform eviction.\n"
"eviction_ratio determines the portion of stored objects that would be evicted.\n"
"default_kv_lease_ttl controls the default lease TTL for KV objects (milliseconds).\n"
"configure it via --default_kv_lease_ttl and keep it larger than ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT and ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT."
msgstr ""
"eviction_high_watermark_ratio 决定 Mooncake Store 执行驱逐的水位线。\n"
"eviction_ratio 决定将被驱逐的已存储对象的比例。\n"
"default_kv_lease_ttl 控制 KV 对象的默认租约 TTL（毫秒）。\n"
"通过 --default_kv_lease_ttl 进行配置，并保持其大于 ASCEND_CONNECT_TIMEOUT 和 ASCEND_TRANSFER_TIMEOUT。"

msgid "#### 5.4.2 Start the Prefill Node with Pooling"
msgstr "#### 5.4.2 启动带池化的 Prefill 节点"

msgid ""
"On the Prefill node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
"`LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, `MODEL_PATH`, and\n"
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR` for the local environment."
msgstr ""
"在 Prefill 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。根据本地环境设置\n"
"`LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH` 和\n"
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR`。"

msgid ""
"Start the four DP4/TP4 Prefill engines with the launcher command from "
"Section 5.2.2.2 after all Decode engines are ready."
msgstr "在所有 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用 5.2.2.2 节中的启动器命令启动四个 DP4/TP4 Prefill 引擎。"

msgid "#### 5.4.3 Start the Decode Node with Pooling"
msgstr "#### 5.4.3 启动带池化的 Decode 节点"

msgid ""
"On the Decode node, save the following script as `run_dp_template.sh`. Set\n"
"`LOCAL_IP`, `NIC_NAME`, `MODEL_PATH`, and\n"
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR` for the local environment."
msgstr ""
"在 Decode 节点上，将以下脚本保存为 `run_dp_template.sh`。根据本地环境设置\n"
"`LOCAL_IP`、`NIC_NAME`、`MODEL_PATH` 和\n"
"`MOONCAKE_CONFIG_DIR`。"

msgid ""
"Start the eight DP8/TP2 Decode engines with the launcher command from "
"Section 5.2.2.3."
msgstr "使用 5.2.2.3 节中的启动器命令启动八个 DP8/TP2 Decode 引擎。"

msgid "#### 5.4.4 Startup and Verification"
msgstr "#### 5.4.4 启动与验证"

msgid ""
"Start the components in this order: Mooncake Master Service, Decode engines, Prefill engines, and then the PD proxy. The Mooncake Store clients are embedded in the vLLM processes; no standalone Store process is required for this configuration.\n"
"Wait until the Mooncake master process reports successful initialization before starting the Decode engines and the Prefill engines. After every Prefill engine and every Decode engine is ready, start the proxy with the same endpoint mapping described in Section 5.2.2.4."
msgstr ""
"按以下顺序启动各组件：Mooncake Master Service、Decode 引擎、Prefill 引擎，最后是 PD 代理。Mooncake Store 客户端内嵌在 vLLM 进程中；此配置无需独立的 Store 进程。\n"
"在启动 Decode 引擎和 Prefill 引擎之前，请等待 Mooncake master 进程报告初始化成功。待所有 Prefill 引擎和所有 Decode 引擎就绪后，使用第 5.2.2.4 节中描述的相同端点映射启动代理。"

msgid ""
"Send the same request twice with a reusable prefix. Confirm that Prefill "
"logs show Mooncake lookup, get, put, and hit activity, and that Decode logs "
"still show normal Prefill-to-Decode KV transfer."
msgstr ""
"使用可复用的前缀发送同一请求两次。确认 Prefill 日志显示 Mooncake 的 lookup、get、put 和 hit 活动，并且 "
"Decode 日志仍显示正常的 Prefill 到 Decode 的 KV 传输。"

msgid ""
"- `MultiConnector` combines live P-to-D transfer through `MooncakeHybridConnector` with persistent prefix reuse through `AscendStoreConnector`.\n"
"- `backend: \"mooncake\"` selects Mooncake as the KV Cache Pool backend.\n"
"- `use_layerwise: false` is required for DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash. Do not enable layerwise pooling for this model because its CED hybrid-attention structure is not supported by the layerwise path."
msgstr ""
"- `MultiConnector` 通过 `MooncakeHybridConnector` 实现实时的 P 到 D 传输，并通过 `AscendStoreConnector` 实现持久化前缀复用。\n"
"- `backend: \"mooncake\"` 选择 Mooncake 作为 KV Cache Pool 后端。\n"
"- DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash 需要设置 `use_layerwise: false`。请勿为此模型启用 layerwise 池化，因为其 CED 混合注意力结构不受 layerwise 路径支持。"

msgid "### 5.5 Multi-Node Colocated Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.5 多节点共置部署"

msgid "### 5.6 Service Verification"
msgstr "### 5.6 服务验证"

