"[release notes](../../user_guide/release_notes.md). When reporting results, record the\n"
"checkpoint, prompt encoder, reasoning effort, sampling parameters, dataset\n"
"version, and whether DSpark is enabled."
msgstr ""
"请参阅[使用 AISBench](../../developer_guide/evaluation/using_ais_bench.md)\n"
"以评估已部署的服务。精度结果将记录在\n"
"[发布说明](../../user_guide/release_notes.md)中。报告结果时，请记录\n"
"checkpoint、prompt encoder、推理强度、采样参数、数据集\n"
"版本以及是否启用了 DSpark。"
